# This repo no longer reads a local .env file. Secrets come from Doppler.
#
# Run every script through the Doppler CLI so the real keys are injected into
# the process environment at launch — nothing is stored on disk:
#
#   doppler run --project ent-agency-automation --config dev -- python3 <script>.py
#
# Keys used by tools/config.py (all already live in that Doppler project/config):
#   KIE_API_KEY            — Kie AI (Nano Banana Pro image gen + Kling/Sora video gen)
#   GOOGLE_API_KEY         — Google AI Studio (Nano Banana/Pro images + Veo 3.1 video)
#   WAVESPEED_API_KEY      — WaveSpeed AI (backup video provider)
#   REPLICATE_API_TOKEN    — Replicate (FLUX images, LTX/Wan/CogVideoX/Minimax video,
#                            also proven for Nano Banana Pro — see references/docs/iish-brand-kit.md)
#   AIRTABLE_API_KEY       — only needed for the Airtable-review-hub workflow (CLAUDE.md Workflow 1/2)
#   AIRTABLE_BASE_ID       — same
#
# doppler login once per machine (`doppler login`), then `doppler setup` in this
# directory to bind it to the ent-agency-automation/dev config, and every command
# above just works. Never recreate a .claude/.env with real values — see
# .claude/.env.deprecated for the file this replaced and why it was retired.
